# Oak UI design

Follow [`design/README.md`](../../design/README.md) and [`design/tokens.md`](../../design/tokens.md). CSS variables live in `extension/src/sidebar/athens-tokens.css`. Do not invent new hex, radii, or type sizes in components.

## Shell

Signed-in chrome is one identity row (Oak Face, Oak, display name, worker-count chip, Help, icon-only sign out), then Fill / Q&A / Custom tabs, then the list. Connection belongs in the footer, not under the header. Generate, Fill page, and Recommend share a sticky pill row. Help opens a sidebar page of large live faces for every mode.

## Density

Give vertical space to the list. Do not add Fetch DOM, “pick a Worker pool…”, “no job attached”, “Athens account”, or “Signed in as … Sign out” copy.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<h3>Athens account</h3>
<p>Signed in as {name}</p>
<button>Sign out</button>
<p>No Worker pool job attached to this tab.</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="brand-bar">
  <OakFaceView className="brand-logo" />
  <h2>Oak</h2>
  <p className="brand-user">{name}</p>
  <div className="brand-actions">
    <div className="brand-workers">{total}</div>
    <button className="brand-icon-btn" aria-label="Oak Face guide" />
    <button className="brand-icon-btn" aria-label="Sign out" />
  </div>
</div>
```

## Cards

The card is the open/focus target. No `>` chevron (`worker-pool-open::after` or extra buttons). Fill and Custom share `SidebarListCard`: 32px company logo (Fill) or tab favicon (Custom) with an 18px Oak Face silhouette badge on the bottom-right (no plate). Both stay visible. Download and eye are disabled until a résumé exists. Custom check forgets the tab. Selected cards use the same `--athens-brand` fill and `--athens-canvas` type.

## Notices

Expected failures (sign-in, socket, Fill, download) use `pushOakNotice` / `broadcastOperatorNotice`. Do not `throw` or `console.error` them — Chrome’s extension Errors list will show those.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
throw new Error('Sign in failed');
console.warn('[Oak] socket connect_error:', err.message);

// ✅ GOOD
pushOakNotice({
  kind: 'error',
  title: 'Couldn’t sign in',
  detail: 'Check your username and password.',
});
```

## Tokens

Use `--athens-*` only. Pills for tabs/CTA/icon buttons; `--athens-radius-md` for list cards; `--athens-brand` as the only accent.
